; İstif setup texts: Chinese (Simplified).
; Translators: copy this file as <language code>.isl (de, fr, es, it, pt, ru, ar, zh, ja, ko), translate only the
; text after "=", keep the key names. "%n" is a line break. Save the file as UTF-8 with BOM.
; setup\Istif.iss adds a language automatically when this file and Inno Setup's own message file both exist.

[CustomMessages]
; Name of the .istif file type in Windows Explorer
DosyaTuruAdi=İstif 装载方案
; Shown when the .NET 8 Desktop Runtime is missing; the setup stops
DotNetYok=此程序需要 Microsoft .NET 8 Desktop Runtime (x64)，但在这台电脑上未找到。%n%n请从 Microsoft 下载并安装“.NET Desktop Runtime 8”(x64)，然后重新运行此安装程序：%nhttps://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet/8.0%n%n现在在浏览器中打开该页面吗？
; Shown when the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime is missing; the setup stops
WebView2Yok=此程序需要 Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime，但在这台电脑上未找到。Windows 11 已自带该组件。%n%n请从 Microsoft 下载并安装“Evergreen Bootstrapper”或“Evergreen Standalone Installer”，然后重新运行此安装程序：%nhttps://developer.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/%n%n现在在浏览器中打开该页面吗？
